      "TESS: I can’t pee. Jane frowns, thinks, then crosses to the sink and turns on the FAUCET..\nJANE: Remember the Palumbo’s swimming pool, how warm the water was...? Silence. Then TINKLING. Jane smiles, proud. Just then, the BRIDE, TRINA blo…",
      "NANCY: L knew it!\nJANE: What?\nNANCY: | Either you were just getting freaky in the john, or you were at that other wedding.\nJANE: I...-L1 didn’t want to let the other brides down.",
      "JANE: No! I’m not a Trekkie! I just like the Vows section. It’s, you know, it’s the only happy part of the paper...\nTESS: Right. Well. Don’t worry, your geek-ret is safe with me.\nJANE: Geek-ret, that’s funny. Jane looks at her watch -- shit ~- and hurries into the bathroom, starts getting ready for the night.\nJANE: Hey, wanna come out with me tonight? I’ve got a party with some work people.",
      "TESS: You want to comer\nJANE: Nah, I’m exhausted...\nJANE: you two have a great time. I’m just going to go home and maybe--\nTESS: Okay! ‘Night! They wave and blow out of there. JANE | --drink nail polish remover til I black out...",
      "TESS: I’m going to have the tofu casserole. Jane looks up, shocked.\nJANE: You know that tofu casserole has tofu in it, right?"
    ]
