    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 2,
        "text": "Mozart composed his first sonata when he was just five years old. Claude Monet started painting when he was three, and Tiger Woods swung his first golf club well before his first birthday. I was five years old, at my cousin Trina’s wedding - the year was 1986..."
